WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Review Settings, then open sudo lnpctl in Ghostty.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Filter with / and demo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Select the three unwanted demo apps. Keep Demo Keep unselected.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Review the selection, then prepare a backup.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Save the Recovery checklist. Live permissions are unchanged.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Boot into Recovery. Choose Options, then Continue.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Check Data in Disk Utility. It is already mounted in this VM.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Open Terminal from the Utilities menu.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Run the prepared lnpctl-recovery launcher. Choose backup 1.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Review all three removals. Choose a to apply.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:09.500
Confirm with y. Cleanup completes and is verified.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:15.500
SIP remains enabled. Reboot into macOS.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.500
Reboot and login waits shortened.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:27.500
The three old entries are gone from Settings. Ghostty, Demo Keep, and Chrome remain allowed.

